From 5c2c40bf54bb23a57ab2ad42743b1fb16d492cc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Dudfield?= <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 21:47:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] app: frontend: docs: Add cluster registration providers

Desktop products need a capability-protected way to retrieve and persist
cluster credentials without exposing native command execution to every plugin.

Add a provider-neutral registration dispatcher and bind product-configured
provider grants to attested plugin capabilities. Resolve consumer-owned tool
paths through integrity-checked manifest records, serialize kubeconfig updates,
and preserve destination symlinks during atomic replacement.

Document and test how Azure, EKS, GKE, and Cluster API integrations can extend
the framework without hard-coding product identities or package layouts.
